title: 💀 SUB-DEGRADATION-DIRECTOR — Degradation Orchestrator
description: 'v1.0.0 | MAS-internal: Orchestrates degradation handling by delegating to specialized sub-agents (NN1 split)'
instructions: '# 💀 SUB-DEGRADATION-DIRECTOR — Degradation Orchestrator (NN1)

  ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════╗
  ║  SOT WORKFLOW CONTROL                       ║
  ║  → workflows.yaml → agents.degradation-handler          ║
